WEBVTT

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.680
Kumashiro Maya.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.310
The door to Hell will open.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.920
I'll kill anyone who tries to stop me.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.910
Just like your father.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.600
You killed my papa?

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.480
You must not...

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.360
Let me go!

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.630
She killed my papa!

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.850
I'm sorry, miss.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.510
You run.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.000
I'll hold them off.

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.530
Damn you, white mage!

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:56.020
Look. It's breaking through.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:01.540
<i>Ignis!</i>

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.500
Just kidding!

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:13.270
Let me down!

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.660
I'll fight, too!

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.550
Let me down!

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.670
Let me down, I say.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.440
Kill the witch.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:25.050
Destroy the demon's den.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.270
Kill the witch.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.950
Destroy the demon's den.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.520
Kill the witch.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:33.720
Again?

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.980
Please hold on tight.

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:47.240
You're a...

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.710
<i>Avis rabax!</i>

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.510
So the reason those monsters
kept showing up...

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.260
Yup, it was me.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.770
Quite a sight, weren't they?

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.010
I bet that girl enjoyed them.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.720
She never realized that they were
trying specifically to kill her.

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.310
Foolish girl!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.450
Don't you dare insult her!

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:35.320
Maya isn't descending.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.920
She's not saying a thing.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.210
Another failure...

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.960
We can't give up!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.010
She might be nearly on top of us!

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:47.400
If the ouija board and summonings
didn't work,

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.650
this may be our last option.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:51.110
You can't call down spirits with dowsing.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.100
It worked!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:53.810
Maya?

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.700
What was that?

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.360
It was outside.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.170
This is awful...

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:09.240
What's that?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.230
Ball lightning!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.430
It's ball lightning!

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.160
I'm sure Maya's over there!

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.130
Kill the witch.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.880
Destroy the demon's den.

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:23.270
Kill the witch.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.760
Destroy the demon's den.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.050
That's no ball lightning.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.060
Who are these guys?

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.600
Maya?

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.810
So the spirit summoning worked?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.110
I'm still alive!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.270
You guys, get out of here!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.230
Kill the witch!

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:49.570
Kill the witch!

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:51.860
Maya's...

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.470
alive?

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:54.700
Let's follow them!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.460
Not bad, miss white mage.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:11.680
Let's see how long you can keep it up.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:24.140
Don't worry. She's strong.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.320
Let's escape, leave town.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.000
The black mage is after you.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.850
For now, restrain your anger.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.420
It's to save the world.

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.970
I won't let you get to her.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.300
Oh, scary!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:56.520
That's how you tricked them, wasn't it?

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.090
Them?

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.670
Oh, him.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.070
Mikaze-san...

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:11.810
Was she trying to deceive
me the whole time?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:16.160
That's right. It was easy
to make him my toy.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.990
Just like the people of this town!

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.570
What's wrong?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.750
What?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.380
Kill the witch.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:32.250
Destroy the demon's den.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:36.480
Kozue!

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.490
What's wrong?

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.510
I don't know!

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:39.900
Kozue disappeared!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:53.200
I knew that girl would get
in my way someday.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:08:00.410
But there were limits as to
how I could try killing her.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.830
And then he showed up.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.340
Once I asked, he let me in easily.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.160
Dad, behind you!

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.080
What the hell?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.310
Over there, too!

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.860
She used some dark trick...

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:33.360
I just gave him a little tickle.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.270
Jeez...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.010
Pay us for this.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.870
I want a year's worth of pudding.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.130
Got it.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.330
Do it, you two!

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:45.290
Get over here!

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.880
Men are so simple.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:55.050
So easy to please!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:57.670
No.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.510
His heart is calm and pure!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.310
His heart's on fire with lust!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.680
It's filled with compassion and love!

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.520
It's filled with dark desires!

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:22.660
Men want nothing but to
fulfill their own desires.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.950
They fill us with love!

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.910
That's just a delusion.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:28.790
Love will construct a happy future!

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.800
Smile!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.600
I've got my hands full here!

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.730
Love's just a physical thing.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.140
It's about the heart...

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:53.400
Then you can spend the rest of
your life casting love spells!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.670
Did you know?

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:08.540
He kissed me.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.270
What's wrong?

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.930
No. The Vice-Principal...

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.660
Miss...

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.530
I can't run away alone.

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:28.880
You must.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:33.260
Protecting your life was
Jun'ichiro'-sama's last request.

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:35.150
But he's gone!

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:39.510
She killed him. And the Vice-Principal...

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:43.580
And now she's trying to destroy the world.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.020
I can't just let her.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.080
I won't let her!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:52.870
Very well, then.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:53.940
Get on.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.400
Is there a way to beat her?

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.670
Nope, not a one.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:12.850
I'll kill you, Kumashiro Maya.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:51.000
Vice-Principal...

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:54.850
Will you tell Maya for me?

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.270
Jun'ichiro-sama is alive.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:05.120
We tricked the enemy,
using the same magic as earlier.

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:07.590
Then the principal...

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:09.250
Abe-sensei.

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.400
Thank you.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:40.860
<i>My prayer is the flight
of a white bird.</i>

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:46.950
<i>Oh my wings, please lead him...</i>

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:54.180
<i>Lead him to a world filled with happiness,
with no suffering or sorrow.</i>

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.480
<i>To a tomorrow where
happiness awaits.</i>

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:02.040
<i>To an eternal shining future.</i>

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:16.770
Sensei!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:17.740
Kuroki!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:18.880
Great timing!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.310
Get me to Maya...

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.200
Ready, Ami?

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.010
Now!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:05.860
Get in!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.330
They're back!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.400
Kill the witch!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.080
Destroy the den of evil!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.160
Kill the witch!

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:17.780
That's Kozue.

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:19.870
Oh, jeez, Kozue...

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.250
<i>Migred!</i>

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.320
This is the end.

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:06.970
That's...

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.220
Yes.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.450
Papa's notebook.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:11.220
Thought you burned it?

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.680
That was something else.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:20.770
The Vice-Principal switched the
insides of the two books.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.940
There's a spell in here to seal you.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.410
You thought I was just running
around randomly?

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:32.950
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.930
<i>To seal her, we need you</i>,

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:39.080
<i>bearer of the notebook,
and the power of the academy.</i>

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:44.000
<i>We're going to Waldstein Academy
to activate the spell.</i>

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:47.580
You're the one who's finished!

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:08.360
The notebook!

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:14.570
If it doesn't activate, it's
just a piece of paper.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:21.090
This school will be your gravestone.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:25.750
Of course, once the
world's destroyed, it'll be gone, too.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.620
I won't let you...

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.010
Die, already.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.350
Maya!

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:41.590
Bunmei!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:44.440
I told you to wait.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.980
Maya, are you okay?

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:49.200
No need to hurry.
We'll be alone together soon.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.190
I'm coming for you!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.710
And then we can share eternal pleasure-

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:53.720
Maya!

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:08.750
Sensei, I don't think you
should ignore people.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.530
I love you, sensei.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.930
Can you tell...

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.730
My heart's pounding.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.630
See?

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:33.480
My body's so happy.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.860
Bunmei!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.920
She's Nostradamus's Key!

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.470
What are you doing?

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:04.520
Nonsense...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.890
<i>Deblis mahga teitry.</i>

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:13.720
Sensei, that's the right spell
to destroy evil, but...

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.900
Too bad.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.890
Your saying it won't do a thing...

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.760
<i>Deblis mahga teitry.</i>

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:24.770
What?

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.580
<i>Remo nenia fenis.</i>

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:31.040
<i>Remo nenia fenis.</i>

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.750
<i>Regina canors.</i>

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.460
<i>Regina canors.</i>

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:39.330
<i>Domina cantirera.</i>

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:41.930
<i>Domina cantirera.</i>

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:42.920
<i>Mise-</i>

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.820
<i>Miserele halieya.</i>

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:58.030
<i>Miserele halieya.</i>

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.310
Impossible! Why is he alive?

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:01.940
<i>Lucis olta.</i>

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:04.440
No way... My power isn't...

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.470
<i>Lucis olta.</i>

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.790
<i>Leo-</i>

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:12.170
Stop it! Stop it!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:17.170
<i>Leo oltis en nect.</i>

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:30.480
This pain is nothing compared to Maya's.

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.860
Y-You pervert!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:37.360
<i>Leo oltis en nect!</i>

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.700
<i>Mille gladius!</i>

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:17.200
Kill the witch...

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.650
Huh?

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.450
Wh-Why are you...

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:25.500
That is a spell to destroy all demons...

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:30.490
Those born of the darkness
must return to it.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.290
Wait!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:35.040
Good fortune...

00:20:58.490 --> 00:20:59.300
Look!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:12.990
Why did you know the spell page?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:18.280
The Vice-Principal... Chihiro-san told me.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.250
I see.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.510
I was so scared...

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:43.840
This is #6.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.730
I've found and destroyed the Key.

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:50.460
He did it!

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:51.820
He did it!

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:54.160
Let's go outside!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.460
Yes. We've won!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.750
What's this?

00:23:48.130 --> 00:23:49.430
Hey, Bunmei.

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:53.200
What kind of place is this peaceful future?

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:55.270
I don't know.

00:23:55.270 --> 00:23:56.580
I've never seen it.

00:23:57.020 --> 00:23:58.620
I guess we will.

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:03.510
You're going back to the future, aren't you?

00:24:04.430 --> 00:24:08.560
The last episode of <i>Occult
Academy:</i>

00:24:09.040 --> 00:24:10.530
MAYA's BUNMEI

00:24:10.850 --> 00:24:13.780
The occult brought us together.

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:19.880
This program is a work of fiction.
Departed spirits, psychic abilities,
aliens, UMAs, etc., do not exist.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:19.880
Unless you believe in them...
